 filename←PolishInifilePath filename
⍝ Returns `filename` as an absolute path. A relative name is taken relative to the current
⍝ directory, which `Run` has set to the folder of the workspace by then (see `F.PolishCurrentDir`).
⍝ A name that starts with "~" is left alone.
⍝ Signals 6 when there is no such file.
 :If '~'≠⊃filename
     filename←⊃,/1 ⎕NPARTS filename
 :EndIf
 :If ~F.IsFile filename
     ('No INI file found: ',filename)⎕SIGNAL 6
 :EndIf
⍝Done
